OQ = [
 ('OQ-01','Account approval','1. Create a new account from the sign-in page. 2. Sign in with it. 3. As admin, open Team and Access and approve it with one role.','Before approval the user sees no records. After approval the user sees only the modules of that role.','acc'),
 ('OQ-02','Access levels','Give a user View on QMS. Try to close a deviation; then give Full and try again.','With View the close action is not offered and is refused; with Full it works.','acc, qms'),
 ('OQ-03','Reason for change and void','Edit a facility log entry without a reason, then with a reason. Void an entry with a reason. Open Audit Trail.','Edit without reason is refused. The change and the void appear in Audit Trail with user, time, old/new values and reason; the voided entry still shows as VOID.','a, fl3'),
 ('OQ-04','License separation','Switch to the second license.','Records of the first license are not shown; creating a record stores it under the second license.','scope'),
 ('OQ-05','Supplier and receiving','Receive a lot from a supplier that is not approved; then approve the supplier and receive again. Try to use the lot in a batch before acceptance.','Unapproved supplier refused. Lot sits in quarantine and cannot be used until Full access accepts it.','suppliers, mat'),
 ('OQ-06','Hold and shipping','Put a batch on hold; try to ship it. Release the hold with a reason (Full access); ship it with a passed pre-load check.','Held batch cannot be shipped; release needs a reason; shipment saved with SHP number.','mat'),
 ('OQ-07','Batch record','Create a batch for a switched-on SKU; fill fields as a team member; try to change a filled value as a team member, then as admin without and with a reason.','Team member can only fill blanks; admin change needs a reason; history shows in Audit Trail.','b'),
 ('OQ-08','Line clearance','Start a batch without a line clearance; then record a clearance.','Dashboard and batch card flag the missing clearance until it is recorded.','lc'),
 ('OQ-09','Trace and mock recall','Run a trace on a lot used in a batch that was shipped; start a mock recall and complete it.','Trace shows supplier lot → batch → customers; the mock recall time is recorded against the 2-hour target.','recall'),
 ('OQ-10','Deviation and CAPA','Report a deviation; try to close without a correction; mark root cause required and close without it; add correction and root cause; open a CAPA and try to close it rated Partially effective.','Each early close is refused; deviation closes with correction + root cause; CAPA stays open until rated Effective.','qms'),
 ('OQ-11','SOP control','Write an SOP draft; publish it with Full; sign it as a user; revise it without a reason, then with a reason.','Publish stamps approver and date; revision without reason refused; new version created, old one kept; users asked to sign again.','sop'),
 ('OQ-12','Training','Assign a course to a role; take the online quiz and fail it; then pass.','Fail is recorded and the requirement stays open; pass closes it in the matrix.','training, online'),
 ('OQ-13','Testing and COA','Submit a final-tag batch for testing; upload a COA and use AI read; check every value against the PDF; save Passed; try to change it to Failed without a reason.','AI values are shown for review before saving; final result change without reason / without Full is refused.','t'),
 ('OQ-14','Facility log kiosk','Open the facility log kiosk link on a tablet; record a sanitation entry with signature.','Entry saved under the license with time and signature; shows in Facility Logs.','fl3'),
 ('OQ-15','HACCP monitoring','Record a CCP reading outside the critical limit without a corrective action, then with one.','Without the action it is refused; with it the record is saved and waits for second-person review.','haccp'),
 ('OQ-16','Inspector view','Open Standards inspector view for a license.','Read-only clause list with linked live records; no edit buttons.','std'),
 ('OQ-17','Change control','Raise a change, approve (Full), try to implement with training not done; complete it and close with effectiveness check.','Implementation blocked while required training/trial/notifications are open; closes only with effectiveness check.','rc'),
 ('OQ-18','Printing','Print a batch record, an SOP and the risk register.','Each printout has the business header, logo, footer and page content complete.','st'),
 ('OQ-20','System Health','Open System Health as admin; open it as a non-admin.','Admin sees every check with pass / check / fail and can print it; non-admins do not see the page.','sh'),
 ('OQ-21','Electronic signature','Approve a test SOP: cancel the signature box; then type a wrong password; then the right one. Open Audit Trail.','Cancel and wrong password save nothing; the right password publishes the SOP and keeps a signature with your name, meaning and time.','sec'),
 ('OQ-22','Two-step sign-in and sign-out','Require two-step sign-in for a test user; sign in with password only; then with the code. Set sign-out to 1 minute on the test license and wait.','No access until the code is entered; the user is warned and then signed out after 1 minute idle.','sec'),
 ('OQ-23','My Tasks and alerts','Make a test user responsible for a CAPA due yesterday; open their My Tasks. Place a test hold.','The CAPA is listed first as overdue; an alert email reaches people with Full access on Hold and Release within 10 minutes and is in Settings > Email.','tk'),
 ('OQ-24','Kiosk without internet','On a test kiosk turn Wi-Fi off; scan a badge and fill a log entry; turn Wi-Fi on.','Both are saved on the tablet, then appear in Hendrix with the real time and marked offline (O); nothing is recorded twice.','off'),
 ('OQ-25','METRC Check','Upload a METRC export where one package is on hold in METRC but not in Hendrix.','The difference is listed as Fix now with the tag; the report prints with sign-off lines.','mc'),
 ('OQ-19','Line Map','Put a test batch on hold; open Line Map; click the batch; release the hold and click Refresh.','The batch turns red at its station with the hold number and reason; after release it moves again.','lm'),
]

